:: Deadwood Raven Shrine Door
<<effects>><<deadwood-raven-home-presence>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    A narrow path passes behind the shrine to a small wooden house. A pair of muddy sandals sits beneath its eaves, beside a brush worn smooth at the handle.
    This is where Tsukihan lives. The shrine's inner room is back across the courtyard.<br><br>
    <<if Time.dayState is 'night'>>The trees hide most of the house from the gate. You can make out the threshold beneath the low roof.
    <<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>Water drips from the roof into a channel beside the step. The threshold is dry beneath the deep eaves.
    <<else>>A little path of flat stones keeps the earth away from the threshold. There are bird tracks between them.<</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    一条窄路绕过神社，通到后侧的小木屋。檐下摆着一双沾泥的鞋，旁边靠着一把木柄磨得光滑的刷子。
    这里是月羽住的地方。祭祀用的内室还在庭院另一侧。<br><br>
    <<if Time.dayState is 'night'>>树影把小屋遮去了大半，低低的屋檐下还能看清门槛。
    <<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>雨水顺着屋顶滴进台阶旁的沟里。屋檐伸得深，门前倒还是干的。
    <<else>>几块平整的石头铺到门前，免得把泥带进屋。石缝间留着细小的鸟爪印。<</if>>
<</language>><br><br>
<<if !_shrineHomeReady or $location isnot 'forest_raven_shrine'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You cannot stop here now.' '你现在没法在这里停留。'>><br><br>
<<elseif _shrineHome>>
  <<if _shrineHomeAwake>>
    <<npc Tsukihan>><<person1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<if _shrine.home_action is 'invite'>>
          Tsukihan opens the door and pauses when <<he>> sees you. Then <<he>> moves a folded cloth off the seat inside.<br><br>
          "You can come back here to rest, even when I'm working in the courtyard. Leave the drawers alone, please, and close the door when you go." <<He>> steps aside. "Would you like to come in?"
        <<else>>
          Tsukihan notices you at the doorway and moves a folded cloth off the seat inside.
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>"You can come in, if you wish." <<He>> leaves the door open and steps back.
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>"Coming in? I've kept your place clear." <<He>> glances at the cloth in <<his>> hands before putting it away.
          <<else>>"There you are. I was hoping you would come back." <<He>> makes room at the door. "Stay for a while, if you can."<</if>>
        <</if>>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<if _shrine.home_action is 'invite'>>
          月羽开门看见你，停了一下，把里面座位上的一块折布拿开。<br><br>
          “以后想歇脚，也可以来这儿。我在庭院忙的时候，你自己进来就好。抽屉先别翻，走的时候记得带上门。”<<He>>往旁边让开。“现在，要进来么？”
        <<else>>
          月羽看见你站在门口，把里面座位上的一块折布拿开。
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>“想进来的话，就进来吧。”<<He>>留着门，往旁边让开。
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>“进来么？给你留着位置。”<<He>>看看手里的布，才把它收好。
          <<else>>“你回来了。还在想你什么时候来。”<<He>>让开门口，“要是不赶时间，多陪一会儿吧。”<</if>>
        <</if>>
    <</language>><br><br>
  <<elseif _shrineHomePerson>>
    <<lanSwitch 'The house is quiet. Tsukihan has said you can come back; you can go in quietly without waking them at the door.' '屋里安安静静的。月羽先前说过你可以来，你放轻脚步进去就好，不必在门口把人叫醒。'>><br><br>
  <<else>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan has gone to work in the courtyard. You have been welcome to come in and rest; there is no need to call them away.' '月羽去庭院忙了，先前已经答应让你自己进来歇脚，不必特意把人叫回来。'>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<icon 'raven-shrine/bench.png'>><<lanLink ['Go into the house (0:01)', '走进小屋 (0:01)']>><<deadwood-raven-home-act 'enter'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<elseif _shrine.home_action is 'greet' and _shrineHomeAwake>>
  <<npc Tsukihan>><<person1>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan opens the door a little and greets you. "Were you looking for something? We can talk in the courtyard <<if Time.hour lt 9>>later<<else>>tomorrow<</if>>." <<He>> stays by the threshold, leaving the room behind them private.' '月羽把门打开一些，向你点头。“找我有事么？<<if Time.hour lt 9>>待会儿<<else>>明天<</if>>可以到庭院聊。”<<He>>留在门槛边，没有让你往屋里走。'>><br><br>
<<elseif _shrineKnock>>
  <<lanSwitch 'There is a small sound of crockery from inside. You can knock, or leave Tsukihan to the rest of their day.' '门里传来轻轻的碗碟声。你可以敲门，也可以先不打扰月羽。'>><br><br>
  <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Knock on the door (0:01)', '敲门 (0:01)']>><<deadwood-raven-home-act 'knock'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<elseif _shrineHomeAwake>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Both your arms are bound. You cannot knock on the door.' '双臂被缚，你现在没法敲门。'>><br><br>
<<elseif Time.hour lt 7>>
  <<lanSwitch 'The house is quiet. You leave the door alone.' '屋里没有动静。你没有贸然敲门。'>><br><br>
<<elseif Time.hour gte 9 and Time.hour lt 18>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan is at work in the courtyard. The house is private; you can find them at the shrine instead.' '月羽正在庭院忙。这里是私人的住处，想找人的话，得回神社去。'>><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'The door is closed. It is too late to call on Tsukihan now.' '屋门关着。这时候再敲门，未免太晚了。'>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-raven-home-return>>

:: Deadwood Raven Shrine Room
<<effects>><<deadwood-raven-home-presence>>
<<if !_shrineHome or $location isnot 'raven_shrine_house'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You have not been invited to stay here now. The courtyard is just outside.' '现在还不能留在这里。庭院就在屋外。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-raven-home-return>>
  <<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if _shrineHomePerson>><<npc Tsukihan>><<person1>><</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Tsukihan's bedroom is small enough that the low table has to stand close to the sleeping mats. A book lies open beneath a smooth stone, with a shopping list tucked between its pages.
    Beside it are a pencil, a dark hair cord and a cup resting on a folded cloth.<br><br>
    Bedding is stacked neatly against the wall. A second set has been put within reach for you, with its own pillow and room to spread it beside the table.
    <<if Time.dayState is 'night'>>A shaded lamp leaves a warm circle across the table. Beyond the window, the trees have disappeared into the dark.
    <<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>Rain ticks against the window frame. There is a faint smell of damp wood near the door.
    <<else>>Light through the small window reaches the edge of the mats. A few black feathers have caught in the brush beside the sill.<</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    月羽的寝室不大，矮桌就摆在铺褥子的地方旁边。桌上摊着一本书，用光滑的石头压着，书页里夹了一张采购单。
    旁边还有铅笔、深色发绳，以及一只垫着折布的杯子。<br><br>
    被褥整齐地叠在墙边。给你用的另一套已经放到方便拿取的地方，也备了枕头。留宿的话，可以自己铺一床。
    <<if Time.dayState is 'night'>>有罩的灯在桌上投下一圈暖光。窗外的树已经隐进了夜色。
    <<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>雨点轻敲窗框，门边有一点湿木头的气味。
    <<else>>小窗透进的光落到褥子边沿。窗台旁的刷子上还挂着几根黑羽。<</if>>
<</language>><br><br>
<<if _shrineHomeAwake>>
  <<switch _shrine.home_action>>
    <<case 'talk'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You sit by the table. Tsukihan turns the shopping list face down and gives you <<his>> attention.<br><br>
          "I bought the wrong cord last time. It looked just the same in the shop." <<He>> holds two short lengths side by side, then puts them away before the conversation becomes another job.
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>"No errands now. I wanted you here to talk to me." <<He>> nudges the list farther away.
          <<else>>"That can wait. How has your day been?"<</if>> You settle into the quiet conversation together.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你在桌旁坐下。月羽把采购单翻过去，转过来听你说话。<br><br>
          “上回买错绳子了。在店里看着明明一样。”<<He>>拿起两截细绳比了比，赶在话题又变成干活以前，把它们收了回去。
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>“现在不派活。我是想让你来陪我说话的。”<<He>>把采购单推得更远了些。
          <<else>>“那些先放着。你今天过得怎么样？”<</if>>你们在桌边慢慢聊起来。
      <</language>>
    <<case 'read'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<if Time.dayState is 'night'>>Tsukihan shifts the lamp so you can both see the page.<<else>>Tsukihan turns the book so you can both see the page.<</if>> The book has a loose thread marking the place, though <<he>> has to turn back twice to find the sentence <<he>> remembers.<br><br>
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>"We can start here. Tell me when you would like me to turn the page."
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>"I stopped just before this part. Don't turn ahead and tell me what happens."
          <<else>>"Wait. That page isn't finished yet." <<He>> puts one finger by the last paragraph. "You can have the next turn. I'm keeping this one."<</if>><br><br>
          You read beside each other, with only the small sound of turning pages between you.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<if Time.dayState is 'night'>>月羽挪了挪灯，好让你们都看得清。<<else>>月羽把书转了转，好让你们都看得清。<</if>>书里夹着一根细线，标着上次读到的地方，可<<he>>还是翻回去两次，才找到记得的那一句。<br><br>
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>“从这里开始吧。看完以后，告诉我一声再翻页。”
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>“上回就停在这儿了。先别往后翻，也别告诉我后面写了什么。”
          <<else>>“等等，这页还没看完。”<<He>>用手指点着最后一段。“下一页让你翻。这页先归我。”<</if>><br><br>
          你们并排看着书，安静里只有偶尔翻动书页的细响。
      <</language>>
    <<case 'tidy'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You help put the loose papers in order, keeping the shopping lists separate from the book. Tsukihan picks up the hair cord before it disappears beneath a stack.<br><br>
          "I was looking for that." <<He>> winds it around two fingers and puts it in a small wooden box.
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>"Leave the book out. We might want it later." <<He>> finds a place for the cups, leaving two seats clear at the table.
          <<else>><<He>> clears the cups to one side. "There. We can actually use the table now."<</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你帮忙把散开的纸张归好，将采购单和书分开放。月羽赶在发绳又被纸压住以前，把它拈了出来。<br><br>
          “刚才还在找这个。”<<He>>把发绳绕在两根手指上，收进小木盒。
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>“书先留着。待会儿也许还要看。”<<He>>把杯子放好，在桌旁空出两个坐的位置。
          <<else>><<He>>把杯子移到一边。“好了。这下，桌子总算能用了。”<</if>>
      <</language>>
    <<default>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Tsukihan sets the book aside when you come in.
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>"Sit wherever you are comfortable. Mind the cup." <<He>> makes certain it is safely out of the way.
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>"I was about to read a little. You could join me." <<He>> leaves the book open between the two seats.
          <<else>>"Come here. I saved you the better cushion." <<He>> presses it once with <<his>> hand. "Stay for a little while before you decide whether to go."<</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          见你进来，月羽把书先放到一边。
          <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>“坐着舒服就好。小心杯子。”<<He>>又把杯子往里挪了一点。
          <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>“刚想看一会儿书。要不要一起？”<<He>>把书摊在两只坐垫中间。
          <<else>>“来这里。软的坐垫给你留着。”<<He>>伸手压了压，“先陪一会儿，再想要不要走吧。”<</if>>
      <</language>>
  <</switch>><br><br>
  <<if _shrine.home_time isnot Math.floor(Time.days) and _shrineHomeMinutes gt 10>>
    <<if !$daily.no_sing and !$worn.face.type.includes('gag')>>
      <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Sit and talk with Tsukihan (0:10)', '和月羽坐着聊聊 (0:10)']>><<deadwood-raven-home-act 'talk'>><</lanLink>><<lstress>><<glove>><br>
    <</if>>
    <<schoolicon 'library'>><<lanLink ['Read with Tsukihan (0:10)', '和月羽一起看书 (0:10)']>><<deadwood-raven-home-act 'read'>><</lanLink>><<lstress>><<glove>><br>
    <<if !pcAreArmsBound('both')>>
      <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Tidy the little table together (0:10)', '一起整理小书桌 (0:10)']>><<deadwood-raven-home-act 'tidy'>><</lanLink>><<ghousekeeping>><<lstress>><<glove>><br>
    <</if>>
  <<elseif _shrineHomeMinutes lte 10>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan puts the loose things away. "I will have to get ready in a moment. You can still rest here."' '月羽把零散的东西收好。“过会儿就得去准备了。你还可以在这里歇着。”'>><br><br>
  <</if>>
<<elseif _shrineHomePerson>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan is still asleep behind the screen. You keep the room quiet; the table and your own bedding are within reach.' '月羽还在屏风后睡着。你放轻了动静，桌子和自己那套被褥都在手边。'>><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan has left for the courtyard. The book is marked with a strip of cloth, and the bedding has been put neatly to one side. You can hear the occasional call of a raven outside.' '月羽已经去了庭院。书里夹着布条，被褥也整齐地搁在一旁。屋外偶尔传来一声渡鸦的叫声。'>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-raven-gift-link>>
<<bedicon>><<lanLink ['Look at your bedding', '看看自己的床铺']>>
  <<deadwood-raven-home-context>>
  <<if _shrineHome and $location is 'raven_shrine_house'>><<goto 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Bed'>><</if>>
<</lanLink>><br>
<<deadwood-raven-home-return>>

:: Deadwood Raven Shrine Wake
<<deadwood-raven-home-context>>
<<if !_shrineHome or $location isnot 'raven_shrine_house'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You are awake. You cannot stay in the house now; the courtyard is outside.' '你已经醒了。现在不能继续留在小屋里，庭院就在门外。'>><br><br>
<<else>>
<<if _shrineHomePerson>><<npc Tsukihan>><<person1>><</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You open your eyes beneath the unfamiliar ceiling. The edge of your own bedding has come untucked, but the pillow is still where you left it.
    <<if Time.dayState is 'night'>>The window is dark. For a moment you hear only the house settling around you.
    <<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>Rain taps the window, and the little room is filled with soft grey light.
    <<else>>Light reaches the low table through the window. The pencil has rolled as far as the folded cloth and stopped.<</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你睁开眼，看见还有些陌生的房梁。自己被褥的一角散开了，枕头倒还留在原处。
    <<if Time.dayState is 'night'>>窗外黑着，有一阵子，你只听见木屋偶尔细微的响动。
    <<elseif Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>雨点轻敲窗户，淡灰色的天光落在小小的房间里。
    <<else>>窗外的光透进来，照到矮桌上。铅笔滚到了折布边，被拦在那里。<</if>>
<</language>><br><br>
<<if _shrineHomeAwake>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if Time.hour lt 9>>Tsukihan is by the doorway, putting a breakfast bowl on a tray. <<He>> looks over when you stir.
      <<else>>Tsukihan sits at the table with a cup between <<his>> hands. <<He>> looks up as you move.<</if>><br><br>
      <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>"Awake? There is water by the table." <<He>> lowers <<his>> voice, giving you a little time to come round.
      <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>"Did you sleep well? I had to stop a raven from coming in to inspect you." <<He>> glances towards the window.
      <<else>>"Finally. I wanted to talk to you <<if Time.hour lt 9>>before I went out<<else>>before bed<</if>>." <<He>> pulls the other cushion closer. "Sit with me when you're ready."<</if>>
      <<if Time.hour lt 9>><br><br>"I have to see to the courtyard at nine." <<He>> leaves the water within reach. "You can take your time getting up."<</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if Time.hour lt 9>>月羽在门边，把一碗早饭放进托盘。听见你翻身，<<he>>转头看过来。
      <<else>>月羽坐在桌边，双手捧着杯子。你一动，<<he>>便抬起头。<</if>><br><br>
      <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>“醒了？桌边有水。”<<He>>放轻声音，留着一点时间，让你慢慢清醒。
      <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 70>>“睡得好吗？刚才还拦了只鸟，差点让它进来看你。”<<He>>朝窗户瞥了一眼。
      <<else>>“总算醒了。还想<<if Time.hour lt 9>>出门前<<else>>睡前<</if>>，先和你说会儿话。”<<He>>把另一只坐垫挪近，“缓过来就坐这边吧。”<</if>>
      <<if Time.hour lt 9>><br><br>“九点还得去料理庭院。”<<He>>把水留在你够得着的地方。“起来不用着急。”<</if>>
  <</language>><br><br>
<<elseif _shrineHomePerson>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan is still asleep behind the screen. You can lie a little longer, or get up quietly without waking them.' '屏风后没有动静，月羽还睡着。你可以再躺一会儿，也可以轻轻起来，不把人叫醒。'>><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan has gone to work in the courtyard. A covered cup stands on the table beside a note: "Water. I will be outside." The room is yours to leave at your own pace.' '月羽已经去庭院忙了。桌上放着一只盖好的杯子，旁边留着纸条：“水。我在外面。”你可以慢慢收拾起来。'>><br><br>
<</if>>

<</if>>
